    "connection-kinds": {
      "description": "Creating a hub connection of a named kind (spec.connection_type, home_assistant among them) and deleting one: the kind must come back in the answer, and a client the API made without it is deleted before the call fails as unsupported; a 422 about the field is unsupported; 402 and 403 plan_limit are a plan refusal, 409 home_assistant_already_linked names the client that holds the link, and 401, 423 and 403 'Insufficient scopes' are an authentication refusal, each keeping the api-errors fields. Delete sends If-Match, reading the etag first when none is given, retries once on 412, and counts 404 as deleted.",
      "files": [
        "src/thalovant/control.py",
