    "device-login": {
      "description": "Device sign-in one step at a time for a caller that runs its own loop: begin returns the code to show and the poll interval; one poll is pending (with the interval, lengthened by five seconds for good on slow_down), expired, denied, or the approved token with its scopes, expiry and id, which the SDK keeps; any other failure carries the api-errors fields. The token a device login minted can revoke itself. Verification URLs with credentials are refused, and neither the device code nor the token appears in an error.",
